[{"title":"题张封君南圃池亭","author":"王慎中","text":"别业借恩光，台池草木香。\n玳梁栖燕子，锦石戏鸳鸯。\n荷密鱼难聚，花繁鸟易藏。\n如何堪比胜，金谷在河阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8014,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽周迹山周以谏杖死","author":"王慎中","text":"降魄兹乡返，精魂何所依。\n刍灵疑榜吏，幽域讶圜扉。\n白日终无照，青春更不归。\n天心垂涕泣，寒雨载途飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8015,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽蔡司成夫人丁氏","author":"王慎中","text":"偕老愿嗟违，兹辰遂并归。\n剑从泉底合，灯向地中辉。\n山雨沾容翣，江霞变阙衣。\n如云车马从，其奈昔时非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8016,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送蔡东洛赴铨改官","author":"王慎中","text":"寒气惊嘶马，离人起戒晨。\n清霜沾劲草，修坂灭流尘。\n为吏儒衣旧，谢官行李贫。\n长安留滞处，当路欲何因。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8017,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朔日昌平城登览","author":"王慎中","text":"宿雨山城净晓晖，高楼凭眺思依依。\n仙人枕上云初散，白马关西雁自飞。\n古木寒鸦啼朔雾，荒隈晓日上征衣。\n天山直北谁传箭，目断秦兵未解围。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8018,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金山杂诗","author":"王慎中","text":"康定陵前栖夜鸟，盘林郁郁锁松梧。\n总闻再造驱戎虏，不见千官拜鼎湖。\n内使司香开寝殿，祠臣常祀扫金铺。\n翠华缥渺空中度，绛节灵应群帝俱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8019,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上送毛太守入觐因寄旧游三山诸友","author":"王慎中","text":"念别须臾已岁余，忽逢江上意何如。\n心悲不语伤时事，眼看双分畏简书。\n远水片帆天际没，晴窗古木岸边疏。\n故人相见倘相问，芳草闲门是谪居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8020,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送郭世重出守南宁","author":"王慎中","text":"郎宁荒绝不堪栖，游客思乡转路迷。\n千岭骤昏知瘴起，四时不断有猿啼。\n编氓半是居蛮峒，行路相言避毒溪。\n十载播迁仍置远，好凭鬼卜问南鸡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8021,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"移居","author":"王慎中","text":"栖栖微禄岂谋身，扰扰移家学避人。\n高柳欲栽当外户，青山依旧借东邻。\n门无车马何须僻，窗映图书不为贫。\n籍系中朝心在野，谁知陆地有沉沦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8022,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登江东城楼","author":"王慎中","text":"花片飞飞柳色深，登楼一倍搅乡心。\n长堤烟草迷人去，远寺斜阳带磬沉。\n江水无风时起浪，春云不雨每成阴。\n踌躇满目谁相会，惆怅前林倦翼禽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8023,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"省中","author":"王慎中","text":"古木阴多莺乱移，白云不去伴留司。\n侵阶草长闲终日，拂印尘深锁几时。\n散地非才容吏傲，低头寸禄令人悲。\n颇耽恬旷频欹枕，仆从翻嫌出省迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8024,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭梁宅之","author":"王慎中","text":"天道苍茫不可知，重泉寂寞所从谁。\n只余兰气芳华省，独有萤光识敝帷。\n无使求书忘旧草，何人脱剑赠枯枝？\n萧条落日闻邻笛，泪尽无由世上期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8025,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄钱洞泉以使事在岭南","author":"王慎中","text":"愬轩更为远游轻，原隰光华阻使程。\n莫遣衣当犀瘴减，遥知句向蜃楼成。\n闲探仙籍朱明洞，吊访图经赵尉城。\n共说交南多宝玉，饮冰心誊自孤清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8026,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"紫骝马","author":"王慎中","text":"朱汗四垂碧玉蹄，缰丝陡勒不胜嘶。\n长安陌上催花雨，万树红英踏作泥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8027,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蓟门行","author":"王慎中","text":"置酒军中舞又歌，雪花偏向蓟门多。\n醉来欲取平胡印，报道天骄已请和。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8028,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凉州词","author":"王慎中","text":"莽莽平沙雁不飞，马头谁复寄征衣。\n欲看春色惟凭柳，柳叶初青春已归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8029,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沧洲道中寄蔡道卿","author":"王慎中","text":"泠泠风举碧罗裳，一曲焦桐月在床。\n寂历寒波兼坠叶，不知何处是潇湘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8030,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苕溪舟上怀蔡可泉","author":"王慎中","text":"岸花夹水备芳鲜，愁思看时倍惨然。\n几欲将愁寄流水，苕溪又不到桐川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8031,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄周中丞备御关口","author":"唐顺之","text":"牙旗高建白羊东，鼓角殷殷瀚海空。\n雪后锦裘行塞外，月明清啸满楼中。\n幕南五部思归义，蓟北诸军尽立功。\n燕颔书生人共羡，一朝投笔去平戎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8032,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张相公寿诗","author":"唐顺之","text":"帷中运策九州清，共说留侯在汉京。\n赐第近连平乐观，入朝新给羽林兵。\n儒生东阁承颜色，酋长西蕃识姓名。\n却望上台多气象，年年长傍紫宸明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8033,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉命分祀孔庙作","author":"唐顺之","text":"后圣礼先师，斯文今在兹。\n将陈百官富，讵止一牢祠。\n入室瞻遗器，圜桥展盛仪。\n乐堪三月听，奠想两楹时。\n执鬯元公肃，捧璋髦士宜。\n鄙儒叨小相，端甫奉前规。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8034,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同院寮观阁中芍药作","author":"唐顺之","text":"西掖衡连翡翠城，笼烟袅雾百花明。\n祗谓紫薇初吐萼，忽言红药已敷英。\n红药葳蕤艳盛阳，万年春色在文昌。\n宁同邺下芙蓉苑，讵比洛阳桃李场。\n裁成异瓣千般锦，结就同心一样黄。\n金阁披时浑是画，绮楼临处并凝妆。\n濯枝故向凤池上，裛露偏依仙掌傍。\n仙掌嶙峋对凤池，词郎侍直鹭鸳齐。\n玲珑玉佩花间映，飖拽罗衫叶下迷。\n花间叶下情无极，含笑含娇似相识。\n羞将鸡舌斗馨香，欲取鸃冠并颜色。\n翠幕分看态转新，朱阑斜倚不胜春。\n未采孤根助灵液，聊持芳蕊赠佳人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8035,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠南都莫工部子良夏至斋宿署中","author":"唐顺之","text":"万乘亲郊幸北宫，千官斋祓两都同。\n灵光正想泥封上，清梦遥依辇路通。\n烟散玉炉知昼永，星分银烛坐宵中。\n闻君已就汾阴赋，犹向周南叹不逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8036,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕咏冰灯","author":"唐顺之","text":"正怜火树斗春妍，忽见清辉映夜阑。\n出海蛟珠犹带水，满堂罗袖欲生寒。\n烛花不碍空中影，晕气疑从月里看。\n为语东风暂相借，来宵还得尽余欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8037,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赵州怀古","author":"唐顺之","text":"千秋霸业消沉尽，风俗犹传赵武灵。\n市上美人挥锦瑟，场中侠客舞青萍。\n雁门北去通沙碛，鸟道西来入井陉。\n欲向平原访公子，萧萧宾馆户长扃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8038,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午日庭宴","author":"唐顺之","text":"南熏应律转朱旗，火帝乘离锦席披。\n榴吐千花承羽盖，蓂开五叶拂瑶墀。\n冰盘错出仙人掌，金缕遥分织女丝。\n复道龙舟方竞渡，衔恩共许向昆池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8039,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈渡草堂二首 其一","author":"唐顺之","text":"皂衣非复汉庭郎，蔽缊深冬卧草堂。\n贫薄不羞畜牸计，沉浮也逐斗鸡行。\n残书阁尽经旬病，异味尝来百草香。\n独愧顽心犹未化，十年学道几亡羊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8040,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹阳别王道思三首 其一","author":"唐顺之","text":"久已废逢迎，萧然世外情。\n因君访茅屋，相送到江城。\n远岫雪中绿，寒流冰下行。\n可堪此时别，独自返柴荆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8041,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿游塘书怀二首 其二","author":"唐顺之","text":"雨过草木好，夜来池馆清。\n露虫疑烛影，风树答书声。\n似瓠甘无用，为膻厌有名。\n且师河上叟，毋使虑营营。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8042,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春游阳羡南山四首 其三","author":"唐顺之","text":"到处暗杉松，多言路不通。\n却从青嶂外，转入绿园中。\n谷口逢茶女，溪边狎钓童。\n勿嫌疏散甚，吾亦是愚公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8043,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题金山寺付僧惠杰四首 其一","author":"唐顺之","text":"何处寻龙藏，停桡听梵音。\n中流一塔影，远树万家阴。\n僧定潮来去，月明江浅深。\n试将空水相，堪比慧公心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8044,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春游阳羡南山四首 其二","author":"唐顺之","text":"洞口石纵横，流泉复有声。\n柴门何处入，鸡犬自相迎。\n灵草知昏晓，时禽识雨晴。\n非因罢官久，谁得此闲行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8045,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春游阳羡南山四首 其四","author":"唐顺之","text":"花落已成蹊，村村绿叶齐。\n一园通蝶戏，千嶂隔莺啼。\n涧草多名蕙，山人旧姓嵇。\n穷欢犹未返，忽是夕阳西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8046,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送白尉往湖州","author":"唐顺之","text":"君家太湖北，作吏太湖南。\n驿路鸡鸣近，山城树影含。\n万川疏沃野，百室竞春蚕。\n幸此犹吾土，微官也自堪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8047,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山庄闲居","author":"唐顺之","text":"身名幸自谢笼樊，白首为农誓不谖。\n惯住山中知鹿性，数行树下识禽言。\n巾车每许邻翁借，书帙间同道士翻。\n醉后渐看松月上，满村鸡犬寂无喧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8048,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再游清溪庄值主人不在次韵","author":"唐顺之","text":"桃树临溪思不禁，扁舟重问草堂阴。\n西湖水落鼋鼍石，南国霜清橘柚林。\n垄际流泉宜稻性，窗前过鹿解人心。\n忆君剪径相迎处，今日蓬蒿又已侵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8049,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题龙池庵三首 其一","author":"唐顺之","text":"远游为访白云岩，转尽孤峰路更南。\n龙见小身时出井，虎驯大士旧开庵。\n禅心客思俱潭水，古佛寒松共石龛。\n坐对老僧无一事，夜深相与说《楞严》。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8050,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠庵中老僧僧解相人术少尝游历江南晚归庵中","author":"唐顺之","text":"早从祝发事栖岩，为礼名师每向南。\n业净六根成慧眼，身无一物寄茆庵。\n厨边引涧宁须汲，松下翻经几到龛。\n若使焚香能证道，前身应说是香严。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8051,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同万鹿园宿工文庵次韵有赠","author":"唐顺之","text":"何处寻山不厌深，淡烟归鸟暮钟音。\n去家百里讶如客，别尔经年尚此心。\n宴坐清香滋夜气，闭门残雪映寒林。\n相从一宿应堪觉，机事何须问汉阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8052,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠督府张半洲兼柬周中丞石崖四首 其一","author":"唐顺之","text":"威名昔日动南荒，斧钺重分定海疆。\n八镇大臣承节制，六千君子备戎行。\n若营内险无如海，但练沙兵略用狼。\n师老寇深为日久，伫看石画一更张。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8053,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠都督万鹿园四首次思节韵 其一","author":"唐顺之","text":"几年枯寂学全真，一握兵机运鬼神。\n骄养义儿皆判死，灰心禅客亦投身。\n独承利镞生如剩，遍散黄金家益贫。\n直欲填桥跨沧海，先声万里走波臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8054,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠都督万鹿园四首次思节韵 其四","author":"唐顺之","text":"寒宵清啸杂征鼙，抚剑刘琨本善诗。\n开幕待降收死力，隔江遣谍刻还期。\n功须因败番成巧，算恰当机不见奇。\n长子帅师今在尔，道傍筑室莫轻为。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8055,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏俞虚江参将四首 其一","author":"唐顺之","text":"将军意气夐无伦，感激宁辞血战频。\n手抟鬼夷尝百种，身悬鲸海历三春。\n扫空巢穴多深夜，夺得艅艎秪数人。\n此日渠魁当授首，策勋早见上麒麟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8056,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏俞虚江参将四首 其三","author":"唐顺之","text":"昔破交夷尚少年，秘经曾自白猿传。\n一军尽署沧溟里，百战常居士卒先。\n龙为求群窥剑匣，蜃因吐气护楼船。\n寻常啮齿非无为，不荡三韩誓不旋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8057,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏俞虚江参将四首 其四","author":"唐顺之","text":"绝岛诸蛮次第芟，中宵蓐食理征衫。\n舱通木井三年水，樯转铜乌万里帆。\n军斗稀鸣人莫犯，身衣常解士争衔。\n功成他日谁能颂，海上磨厓大字嵌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8058,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨教师鎗歌","author":"唐顺之","text":"老杨自是关东客，短衣长躯枣红面。\n千里随身丈八矛，到处寻人斗轻健。\n谓余儒生颇好武，一揖滚滚发雄辩。\n坐惊平地起波涛，蠕蠕龙蛇手中现。\n拨开双龙分海嬉，攒簇两蛇合穴战。\n争先尽教使机关，缩退谁知卖破绽。\n目上中眉犹自哂，绵中裹铁那能见。\n满身护着不通风，百步撺来激流电。\n飞上落下九点丸，放去收回一条线。\n问君何为技至此，使我冯轩神?眩。\n答言少小传授时，五步七步画地践。\n迩来操弄三十年，浑身化作枯树簳。\n心却忘手手忘鎗，眼前只见天花旋。\n乃知熟处是通神，解牛斫轮安足羡。\n因君亦解草书诀，君鎗岂让公孙剑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8059,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峨嵋道人拳歌","author":"唐顺之","text":"浮屠善幻多技能，少林拳法世希有。\n道人更自出新奇，乃是深山白猿授。\n是日茆堂秋气高，霜薄风微静枯柳。\n忽然竖发一顿足，崖石迸裂惊砂走。\n去来星女掷灵梭，夭矫天魔翻翠袖。\n舑舕含沙鬼戏人，髬䰄磨牙贙捕兽。\n形人自诧我无形，或将跟絓示之肘。\n险中呈巧众尽惊，拙里藏机人莫究。\n汉京寻撞未趫捷，海国眩人空抖擞。\n番身直指日车停，缩首斜钻针眼透。\n百折连腰尽无骨，一撒通身皆是手。\n犹言技痒试贾勇，低蹲更作狮子吼。\n兴阑顾影却自惜，肯使天机俱泄漏。\n余奇未竟巳收场，鼻息无声神气守。\n道人变化固不测，跳上蒲团如木耦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8060,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"日本刀歌","author":"唐顺之","text":"有客赠我日本刀，鱼须作靶青丝绠。\n重重碧海浮渡来，身上龙文杂藻荇。\n怅然提刀起四顾，白日高高天囧囧。\n毛发凛冽生鸡皮，坐失炎蒸日方永。\n闻道倭夷初铸成，几岁埋藏掷深井。\n日淘月炼火气尽，一片凝冰斗清冷。\n持此月中斫桂树，顾兔应知避光景。\n倭夷涂刀用人血，至今斑点谁能整。\n精灵长与刀相随，清宵恍见夷鬼影。\n迩来鞑靼颇骄黠，昨夜三关又闻警。\n谁能将此向龙沙，奔腾一斩单于颈。\n古来神物用有时，且向囊中试韬颖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8061,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海上凯歌九首赠汤将军 其三","author":"唐顺之","text":"偃旗休角寂无猜，百丈楼船泊不开。\n夜半贼营流矢满，才惊汉将是飞来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8062,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海上凯歌九首赠汤将军 其七","author":"唐顺之","text":"锦纨爱子亦从军，长鬣苍头总策勋。\n谁夺强王万金首，帐前齐说小郎君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8063,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南征歌十二首 其二","author":"唐顺之","text":"诏锡彤弓出禁城，良家六郡总从行。\n将军旧佩平蛮印，校尉新开横海营。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8064,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南征歌十二首 其三","author":"唐顺之","text":"汉皇有道伏羌胡，南粤何知擅一隅。\n万里出师将问罪，不因大海富明珠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8065,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南征歌十二首 其六","author":"唐顺之","text":"月明吹笛武陵川，马上行人望跕鸢。\n莫怕炎洲饶毒疠，一冬飞雪似胡天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8066,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南征歌十二首 其八","author":"唐顺之","text":"草木千山鼓角风，将军牧马夜郎东。\n灵台向夕占星色，巳报搀抢堕海中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8067,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南征歌十二首 其十","author":"唐顺之","text":"牂牁南去乱峰连，滇海藤江一带悬。\n纵谓蛮封堪画地，不知汉将若从天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8068,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南征歌十二首 其十一","author":"唐顺之","text":"奏凯归来拜冕旒，霍家襁褓更封侯。\n因风为报单于道，汉阙方枭越尉头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8069,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞下曲赠翁东厓侍郎总制十八首 其一","author":"唐顺之","text":"四月旌旗出白狼，千山晴雪照油幢。\n预知水草军无乏，试辨风云虏欲降。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8070,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞下曲赠翁东厓侍郎总制十八首 其二","author":"唐顺之","text":"三晋连年苦被兵，九重拊髀忆豪英。\n诏书更不从中御，万里长城一委卿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8071,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞下曲赠翁东厓侍郎总制十八首 其六","author":"唐顺之","text":"千金买士却何为，一间过于十万师。\n黠虏欲逃头可购，名王未猎客先知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8072,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞下曲赠翁东厓侍郎总制十八首 其七","author":"唐顺之","text":"太师昔日定南荒，亲把长缨系莫王。\n寄语老胡须自爱，射飞休得近边墙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8073,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞下曲赠翁东厓侍郎总制十八首 其八","author":"唐顺之","text":"梯悬半绠哨台高，胡汉邻家隔一壕。\n数日虏中无动静，吉囊东去战黄毛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8074,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞下曲赠翁东厓侍郎总制十八首 其九","author":"唐顺之","text":"虎翼龙蟠大将旗，逆驱流电走妖魑。\n阵前捉得胡王女，赐与营中厮养儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8075,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞下曲赠翁东厓侍郎总制十八首 其十二","author":"唐顺之","text":"健儿白马紫金鞦，不向沙场便酒楼。\n夜来一赌青钱尽，尚有囊中血髑髅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8076,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞下曲赠翁东厓侍郎总制十八首 其十三","author":"唐顺之","text":"边人大半能胡语，胡骑年来亦汉装。\n谁向青红毡帐里，单身缚得不花王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":8077,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]